<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; color: #3D4257; max-width: 34em">Every baseplate has its own color chart, so you only ever work on one section at a time. Bigger mosaics take a few sessions, and many families build them together.</p>
<figure style="margin: 0"><blockquote style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; font-style: italic; color: #0E142C">“Each plate instruction sheet had what color bricks would be needed. That was really helpful to have only those bricks on my craft table.”</blockquote><figcaption style="margin-top: 6px; font-size: 14px; color: #555A6E">Carol D., verified buyer, 30 × 30″</figcaption></figure>
