<section aria-labelledby="faq-title" style="max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px 80px; box-sizing: border-box">
<h2 id="faq-title" style="margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: clamp(28px, 3.2vw, 38px); line-height: 1.15; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #0E142C">Common questions</h2>
<details style="border-bottom: 2px solid #F1DCCB; padding: 4px 0">
<summary style="cursor: pointer; padding: 18px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #0E142C; min-height: 24px">Is it hard to build?</summary>
<p style="margin: 0 0 20px 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; color: #3D4257; max-width: 46em">No. Every baseplate has its own color chart, so you build one section at a time. No glue and no experience needed, and the separator tool in the box makes fixing a mistake easy.</p>
</details>
<details style="border-bottom: 2px solid #F1DCCB; padding: 4px 0">
<summary style="cursor: pointer; padding: 18px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #0E142C; min-height: 24px">How long does a build take?</summary>
<p style="margin: 0 0 20px 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; color: #3D4257; max-width: 46em">It depends on the size. Smaller mosaics can be finished in a session or two, while bigger ones take several. Some customers build one plate a day to make it last.</p>
</details>
<details style="border-bottom: 2px solid #F1DCCB; padding: 4px 0">
<summary style="cursor: pointer; padding: 18px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #0E142C; min-height: 24px">Will it look like my preview?</summary>
<p style="margin: 0 0 20px 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; color: #3D4257; max-width: 46em">Your kit is made from the design you approve. If you want a second opinion first, our designers will check your photo, suggest the size that shows it best, and email you a free proof.</p>
</details>
<details style="border-bottom: 2px solid #F1DCCB; padding: 4px 0">
<summary style="cursor: pointer; padding: 18px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #0E142C; min-height: 24px">When will it arrive?</summary>
<p style="margin: 0 0 20px 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; color: #3D4257; max-width: 46em">It's made and shipped from Miami within 2–4 business days after you approve your design, and you'll get tracking by email.</p>
</details>
<details style="border-bottom: 2px solid #F1DCCB; padding: 4px 0">
<summary style="cursor: pointer; padding: 18px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #0E142C; min-height: 24px">What if a brick is missing?</summary>
<p style="margin: 0 0 20px 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; color: #3D4257; max-width: 46em">Send us the color name and count from your parts list and we'll ship replacements free, for as long as you own the kit.</p>
</details>
</section>

